<item>
<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-10-25T06:31:57.762Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:31:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified cross-border attacks, launching missiles toward Riyadh that were intercepted by the Saudi-led coalition, and striking Saudi oil facilities and airports. The Houthis also renewed threats against Riyadh airport and reported killing 11 people in strikes on Sanaa, while Saudi forces said they shot down two missiles. In Yemen, Houthi attacks on Aden and Sanaa have caused civilian casualties, and Saudi airstrikes in Houthi-controlled areas have also killed civilians, including women and children. The conflict caused 918 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/10/24/houthis-launch-attacks-on-saudi-arabia-and-yemens-aden?traffic_source=rss&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxOanFHRmV4LTNER1VUS1RMVUI0T015WUdfVkFIb2ZONGR0VDA3c09fM3hEd3FIRDgxU1NVQUNLUFJ2ZXRtMXhISVZSX1pXMVRRbnY5U3VaM3JoNkRSQWJISHV2OHh2TlJQY1pEWXNhZWdSQkMwbjRaVXNKS0Q2eEE0WEo1cnVteWQ0VkV0NHM1UXpnbllTV3FtbnhlTXNHR3dmZVdvQ3NvX055WmFZZHFsLW9NRERhem5icVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxNT0JBTVByRUdVWnYzNWpyRUlfbGRFR2RnQzZpbTgzR05tX1AzU2VkVC10RUswYWthSGtJa2FZamVSa2E2ckdSeG5FN3VGTFU5SVJfbjY4NEZjR2tQSWJfZmxtbTJvUU5YSEpKWHRQQWpHMGRfR29xeFhkR1BwcHA5NlA3MnJmRnloYzF6Q0tBZG92ZDgzWmRubVNpNi1CajBmdXdNZmNTYnkzLWFnMldvaQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.france24.com/en/middle-east/20261024-yemen-s-houthi-rebels-claim-new-attacks-on-oil-facilities-and-airports-across-saudi-arabia&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&